<main class="world-page" id="main-content"><section aria-labelledby="awakening-title" class="world-hero ghx-wrap"><div class="world-hero-grid"><div class="world-hero-copy"><p class="ghx-kicker">GhostHeart / The Awakening</p><h1 id="awakening-title">The Awakening.</h1><p class="world-lead">The heart survived. Then it chose a purpose.</p><p>Eight songs in their approved order open this part of GhostHeart. The promise is to protect the light in others and leave room for someone else to rise.</p><nav aria-label="Begin The Awakening" class="world-jump"><a href="/GhostHeart_Story.html">Enter My World</a><a href="/albums/index.html#awakening">Listen to The Awakening</a><a href="/GhostHeart_Resources.html">Help &amp; Resources</a></nav></div><figure class="world-hero-art"><img alt="GhostHeart beneath storm clouds with crimson light over a city horizon" height="1440" src="/assets/story/ghostheart-awakening-banner.png" width="2560"/></figure></div></section><section aria-labelledby="awakening-promise" class="world-prose ghx-wrap"><div class="world-prose-grid"><div><p class="world-section-label">The promise</p><h2 id="awakening-promise">What survived can help someone rise.</h2></div><div class="world-reading"><p><em>This Is GhostHeart</em> introduces the heart behind the work. <em>GhostHeart’s Oath</em> gives that heart a direction. Start with the public reading, listen to the songs, or watch the two films that carry the name and the promise.</p><div class="world-inline-links"><a href="/GhostHeart_Videos.html#film-this-is-ghostheart">Watch This Is GhostHeart</a><a href="/GhostHeart_Videos.html#film-ghosthearts-oath">Watch GhostHeart’s Oath</a></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="awakening-next" class="world-finish ghx-wrap"><div><p class="ghx-kicker">Readings &amp; Live</p><h2 id="awakening-next">Continue with the first reading.</h2><p><em>My Promise</em> is already public. The next planned Sunday Live is October 11, 2026 at 10:00 a.m. Central. The viewing platform and link are pending.</p></div><nav aria-label="Continue The Awakening"><a href="/live/my-promise.html">Read My Promise</a><a href="/live/">Readings &amp; Live details</a><a href="/vault/">Explore the approved Vault</a></nav></section></main><footer class="ghx-footer"><div class="ghx-wrap"><div class="ghx-footer-top"><a class="ghx-brand" href="/index.html">GHOST<span>HEART</span></a><p>Real stories. Real people. Same heart.</p></div><nav aria-label="Official GhostHeart profiles"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@GhostHeart-M95RTK" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">YouTube ↗</a><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@ghosthearted1" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">TikTok ↗</a><a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/68OskMXP10WmzJPexLzRc7" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Spotify ↗</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/ghostheart131517/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Instagram ↗</a></nav><div class="ghx-footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 GhostHeart</span><a href="/GhostHeart_Privacy.html">Privacy</a><a href="/GhostHeart_Resources.html">Support</a><a href="/index.html#join-the-signal">Stay Connected</a></div></div></footer>
